Type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6334,"speakerName":"Matzahtli","textMapHash":3256460234,"text":"So, the biological fire rain is actually those Flowfire Birds falling from the sky? Ah, no wonder they cover way more ground than a normal eruption!","nextNodeIds":[751310202]},{"nodeId":751310202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6334,"speakerName":"Matzahtli","textMapHash":4088511154,"text":"Oh no, what if one of them crashes into my house someday? No, I gotta figure out a plan for this.","nextNodeIds":[751310203,751310206]},{"nodeId":751310203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1071152090,"text":"Well, it's probably just a rare thing.","nextNodeIds":[751310204]},{"nodeId":751310204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6334,"speakerName":"Matzahtli","textMapHash":2336479058,"text":"Yeah, yeah, those Flowfire Birds only get up there because of volcanic eruptions. My house isn't anywhere near a volcano, so I'm probably fine.","nextNodeIds":[751310205]},{"nodeId":751310205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6334,"speakerName":"Matzahtli","textMapHash":297654122,"text":"But... what if — just what if — there's some crazy, massive eruption one day? Wouldn't that mean nowhere is safe? Ugh, no, I still need to come up with a plan... just in case.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751310206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3060201098,"text":"Oops, sorry for interrupting.","nextNodeIds":[751310207]},{"nodeId":751310207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":6334,"speakerName":"Matzahtli","textMapHash":3607612786,"text":"No worries, you're not interrupting... Anyway, let's start by reinforcing the roof.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7513105finish"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_